  unitName: Loving Goddess Tilith
  unitId: 51367
  unitNumber: 8587
  description: Whether decades pass, or even centuries, her love never fades. Having
    visited thousands of worlds and formed bonds with many of the people who inhabit
    them, the Goddess Tilith's heart is no doubt connected to many others regardless
    of distance. With a fearless disposition open to every type of person and every
    type of ideology, everyone is one and the same in her eyes. And even if evil
    threatens to rear its ugly head once again to destroy it all, it still will not
    be enough to stop her love for others.
  summonDesc: Your favorite pretty goddess has arrived! Let's keep moving forward
    together!
  fusionDesc: The power to open the gates to people's hearts is not mine alone.<br>It's
    also yours because it's powered by my friendship with all of you!
  evoDesc: Could it be that I've grown even prettier than before? I didn't even know
    that was possible! Thank you so much for all your help!
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
